---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Healing the Heart | You don't have to carry it alone">
  <section class="hero hero-home">
    <img class="hero-heart" src="/hero-heart.PNG" alt="A cracked heart glowing with warm light" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow light">HEALING • RESTORATION • FREEDOM</p>
      <h1>Healing the<br /><em>Heart</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">Break free from the past. Discover hope for today. Build a healthier tomorrow.</p>
      <div class="actions left"><a class="button primary" href="/classes">Explore Our Classes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button ghost" href="/journey">Discover the journey</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-scroll" aria-hidden="true"><span></span>Begin your journey</div>
  </section>

  <section class="welcome section">
    <div class="narrow center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before anything else</p>
      <h2>You are safe here.</h2>
      <p class="lead">You don't need to pretend you are okay.</p>
      <p>What happened to you matters. You don't have to be ashamed of the places in your heart that still hurt, and you don't have to rush through them.</p>
      <p>Healing is a journey of bringing what has been hidden into the light, replacing lies with truth, and discovering that <strong>Jesus is not frightened by your pain.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement-band"><p>Maybe healing really is possible.</p></section>

  <section class="section journey-preview">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The Healing &amp; Restoring the Heart journey</p><h2>There is a reason your heart learned to protect itself.</h2><p>We make room to understand what happened, what it changed, and what Jesus can restore.</p></div>
    <div class="cards four">
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey"><span>01</span><h3>A Safe Place</h3><p>Confidentiality, compassion, trust, honesty, and freedom from judgment.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#stony-heart"><span>02</span><h3>Understanding the Heart</h3><p>Explore how pain can cause us to harden, disconnect, protect, or stop trusting.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#loss"><span>03</span><h3>Grieving What Was Lost</h3><p>Give words to losses rather than burying or minimizing them.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#restoration"><span>04</span><h3>Truth &amp; Restoration</h3><p>Move toward healthy trust, identity, freedom, and wholeness.</p></a>
    </div>
    <div class="center"><a class="text-link" href="/journey">See the full journey →</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark-section section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow light">What this is about</p><h2>Not fixing you. Walking with you.</h2><p>There are no spectators. The journey invites honest participation through teaching, reflection, prayer, journaling, small-group ministry, and safe relationships.</p></div>
    <div class="pillars"><div><b>Jesus</b><span>Our hope is rooted in Him.</span></div><div><b>Truth</b><span>We make space to recognize the lies pain can teach us.</span></div><div><b>Community</b><span>Healing does not have to happen in isolation.</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section next-step">
    <div class="split-callout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>You can take one small step.</h2></div><div><p>Learn about the journey, see what a class is like, or find upcoming opportunities when dates are available.</p><div class="actions left"><a class="button primary" href="/classes">View classes</a><a class="button outline" href="/contact">Ask a question</a></div></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-header { position:absolute; inset:0 0 auto; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,30,28,.62),rgba(20,30,28,0)); border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); backdrop-filter:blur(7px); }
  .home-header .brand,.home-header .brand-name,.home-header .desktop-nav a { color:#fff !important; }
  .home-header .brand-heart { background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,210,112,.8); color:#ffd270; font-size:.95rem; box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,184,65,.18); }
  .home-header .brand-name { letter-spacing:.18em; }
  .home-header .brand-name i { color:#fff; opacity:1; }
  .home-header .nav-cta { background:#f4bd52; color:#1d211d !important; padding:.75rem 1.25rem; box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.16); }
  .hero-home { min-height:min(920px,100vh); display:flex; align-items:center; background:#9d5a2e; isolation:isolate; }
  .hero-heart { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center; z-index:-3; filter:saturate(1.22) brightness(1.08) contrast(.98); }
  .hero-overlay { position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:-2; background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 52%,rgba(255,191,70,.18),transparent 31%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(31,26,20,.78) 0%,rgba(31,26,20,.47) 24%,rgba(28,23,18,.08) 54%,rgba(42,24,14,.08) 100%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(19,26,24,.16) 0%,rgba(255,151,49,.04) 48%,rgba(93,39,15,.20) 100%); }
  .hero-home::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:auto 0 0; height:170px; z-index:-1; pointer-events:none; background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(53,29,17,.32)); }
  .hero-content { position:relative; max-width:620px; padding:9rem 6vw 7rem; text-align:left; text-shadow:0 3px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
  .hero-content h1 { max-width:620px; margin:0 0 1.35rem; font-size:clamp(4.2rem,8vw,7.8rem); line-height:.88; letter-spacing:-.055em; color:#f8ead8; }
  .hero-content h1 em { color:#f4bd52; font-style:italic; font-weight:400; text-shadow:0 3px 30px rgba(64,32,12,.38); }
  .hero-copy { max-width:500px; margin:0 0 2rem; font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.8vw,1.3rem); color:#f7dfc4; }
  .hero-content .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.15rem; color:#f4c56b; letter-spacing:.22em; }
  .hero-content .actions { gap:1rem; }
  .hero-content .button.primary { background:#f3bd50; color:#1c211d; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
  .hero-content .button.primary span { margin-left:.35rem; font-size:1.05em; }
  .hero-content .button.ghost { border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.48); background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); backdrop-filter:blur(5px); }
  .hero-scroll { position:absolute; right:5vw; bottom:2.3rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size:.65rem; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .hero-scroll span { width:30px; height:1px; background:#ffd270; }
  .welcome { background:#fffaf2; }
  .statement-band { background:linear-gradient(100deg,#ead3b5,#f1c27a 50%,#ead3b5); }
  @media(max-width:800px){ .home-header{position:absolute;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,30,28,.72),transparent)} .hero-home{min-height:88vh;align-items:flex-end} .hero-heart{object-position:center;filter:saturate(1.18) brightness(1.04) contrast(.98)} .hero-overlay{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,27,24,.22),rgba(29,22,16,.16) 35%,rgba(38,23,14,.68) 100%)} .hero-content{max-width:700px;padding:7rem 6vw 5.5rem} .hero-content h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,15vw,6rem)} .hero-scroll{display:none} }
</style>
